Z||000000||gargoyle||09-07-2001||06:08 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I would like to issue a big THANKS to all those who assisted me in troubleshooting my first big problem of no 5th or rev. It did end up being the selector cable but it wasn't broken. It was just stretched, it was about 1/8 to 1/4" longer than the new one. It really wasn't all that bad to change. Of course I have no interior due to the stereo install <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"> from hell. Now I can back into my spot at Fierorama, not push it back. Thanks again!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
